# License  : GPLv2
# Run By   : kfocus-rollback, system processes
# Spec     : 4013
#
# Notice: 'Throws' below refers to when the script exits due to an error
# condition, typically by using _logExitFn. The associated exit code is shown
# alongside the error condition.

# Exit codes are used in these spots. Please audit!
# - main.qml: 4 usages
# - kfocus-rollback-set: 2 sections, 3 uses each (total of 6)
